{"4285470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vellum: Raid Night Study Hall", "steam_appid": 4285470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vellum: Raid Night Study Hall</strong> is your <strong><u>free</u></strong>, personal, MMO boss-killing cheat sheet with a literary spin! Get your practice in, build your confidence, and prepare to <i>not</i> <i>stand in the fire</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study up for a night of raiding sure to make you say &quot;<i><strong>WOW&quot;</strong></i>, mid-fight! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4285470/extras/a99224393440443e5345f2789f94b631.poster.avif?t=1773068834\" width=768 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4285470/extras/a99224393440443e5345f2789f94b631.webm?t=1773068834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4285470/extras/a99224393440443e5345f2789f94b631.mp4?t=1773068834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle Bosses the Write Way!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't need to borrow a pen - <strong>you are one</strong>! Sling Inky spells at your foes to scribble out their healthbars and show these bosses who's boss! Battle through 8 encounters from anticipated raids: <i>Starch for Quail-Ganache, Gleamdrift, </i>and <i>The AnnoyedSpire</i> - with a guest visitor from <i>Vellum</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4285470/extras/74f678f0fb3e76f67a393c3486d2ad6c.poster.avif?t=1773068834\" width=768 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4285470/extras/74f678f0fb3e76f67a393c3486d2ad6c.webm?t=1773068834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4285470/extras/74f678f0fb3e76f67a393c3486d2ad6c.mp4?t=1773068834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Becoming a Quick Study</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic tips help teach you those pesky mid-fight mechanics. When that isn't enough - read up on the Raid Codex to get a more detailed overview of that big glowy thing you stepped in. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you did step in that. The healers saw you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And they take notes... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4285470/extras/41bb7fe3fc7b03bf0622b2413ddf65a7.poster.avif?t=1773068834\" width=768 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4285470/extras/41bb7fe3fc7b03bf0622b2413ddf65a7.webm?t=1773068834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4285470/extras/41bb7fe3fc7b03bf0622b2413ddf65a7.mp4?t=1773068834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not a Stress Test!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failing a lot? Good! Study Hall is built to keep you in the <i>action</i> - not in your <i>head</i>! Whether you're a one-button-wonder or a sweaty hall-of-famer, we could all use a helpful refresher* to be prepared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us in <strong>Vellum: Raid Night Study Hall</strong> while you're itching for the witching hour!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*because we've all <strong>totally</strong> read up on the fights beforehand, of course!</i> </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vellum: Raid Night Study Hall</strong> is your <strong><u>free</u></strong>, personal, MMO boss-killing cheat sheet with a literary spin! Get your practice in, build your confidence, and prepare to <i>not</i> <i>stand in the fire</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study up for a night of raiding sure to make you say &quot;<i><strong>WOW&quot;</strong></i>, mid-fight! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4285470/extras/a99224393440443e5345f2789f94b631.poster.avif?t=1773068834\" width=768 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4285470/extras/a99224393440443e5345f2789f94b631.webm?t=1773068834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4285470/extras/a99224393440443e5345f2789f94b631.mp4?t=1773068834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle Bosses the Write Way!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't need to borrow a pen - <strong>you are one</strong>! Sling Inky spells at your foes to scribble out their healthbars and show these bosses who's boss! Battle through 8 encounters from anticipated raids: <i>Starch for Quail-Ganache, Gleamdrift, </i>and <i>The AnnoyedSpire</i> - with a guest visitor from <i>Vellum</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4285470/extras/74f678f0fb3e76f67a393c3486d2ad6c.poster.avif?t=1773068834\" width=768 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4285470/extras/74f678f0fb3e76f67a393c3486d2ad6c.webm